| Deductible VAT % | `v-model="line.deductableVATPercentage"` | `invoiceLines[n].deductableVATPercentage` |

### Side Effects

| Trigger | Effect | Implementation |
|---|---|---|
| Any amount changes | Recalculate total | `watch` on `invoiceLines` → `calcInvoiceLinesTotal()` |
| Inc VAT checkbox toggle | Recalculate total | `watch` on line `includesTax` → `calcSalesInvoiceLinesTotal()` |
| GL Account change (BE) | Fetch and fill Deductible VAT % | `onGlAccountChange()` → `GlAccountService.getGlAccountSettings()` |
| Add new line | Prefill with remaining amount | `addLine()` → `calculateRemainingAmount()` |
| GL Account change (all lines same) | Sync document GL Account | `SyncUpdateDocumentAndInvoiceLines()` equivalent — **Complete (Phase 7)** |
| Tax Code change (all lines same) | Sync document Tax Code | `SyncUpdateDocumentAndInvoiceLines()` equivalent — **Complete (Phase 7)** |
| Document amount change | Prefill first line amount | `fillStartInvoiceLine()` — **Complete (Phase 7)** |

